      "cooked": "<p>I just installed erpnext LMS and I am experiencing the following issues.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>There is no enrol button for students to enrol</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>When an admin adds a student to a program or batch, it doesn’t create LMS Enrollment doctype and it still shows enrolled to be zero. The count doesn’t add. Even when i manually create an LMS enrolment in a course, it still doesn’t populate.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The email notification does not work</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Course progress is buggy.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>When I am login in the first time, it redirects me to apps instead of app.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/2/a20a1f06a82518b41a5afc11df8d30f6003e954c.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/a20a1f06a82518b41a5afc11df8d30f6003e954c\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/2/a20a1f06a82518b41a5afc11df8d30f6003e954c_2_589x500.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"n7t29FycyixRCUS2CP8vkOfbZqQ\" width=\"589\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/2/a20a1f06a82518b41a5afc11df8d30f6003e954c_2_589x500.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/2/a20a1f06a82518b41a5afc11df8d30f6003e954c.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/2/a20a1f06a82518b41a5afc11df8d30f6003e954c.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F3F4F4\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">749×635 32.2 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n</li>\n</ol>",
